        "accession_number": "0001193125-26-110808",
        "filing_date": "2026-03-17",
        "offering_role": "product",
        "confidence": 0.96,
        "statement": "Fold has identified what we believe to be a unique opportunity in the market to provide bitcoin-native specialty financial services that are currently underrepresented by incumbent financial service providers.",
        "start_character": 41620,
        "end_character": 41829
      },
      {
        "business_evidence_id": "business-evidence:SEC-0001193125-26-110808",
        "provenance_id": "provenance:SEC-FILING-0001193125-26-110808-32d86ad0ecb59e82",
        "accession_number": "0001193125-26-110808",
        "filing_date": "2026-03-17",
        "offering_role": "product",
        "confidence": 0.96,
        "statement": "Our treasury strategy contemplates that we may (i) periodically sell bitcoin for general corporate purposes to support our operating business, (ii) pledge or commit a portion of our bitcoin as collateral for purposes of entering into financing transactions, (iii) utilize our bitcoin as reserve collateral for various products used in our operating business, and/or (iv) consider opportunities to create income streams or otherwise generate funds using our bitcoin holdings.",
        "start_character": 43803,
        "end_character": 44277
      },
      {
        "business_evidence_id": "business-evidence:SEC-0001193125-26-110808",
        "provenance_id": "provenance:SEC-FILING-0001193125-26-110808-32d86ad0ecb59e82",
        "accession_number": "0001193125-26-110808",
        "filing_date": "2026-03-17",
        "offering_role": "service",
        "confidence": 0.96,
        "statement": "We have partnered with Sardine.ai, a third-party provider specializing in supporting Know Your Customer (KYC) services, fraud detection, and sanctions screening efforts.",
